Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hand of Emrakul (7/7, annihilator 1). The opponent is at 7 life and controls only an untapped Wall of Stone (0/8). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-annihilator-before-blocks | Annihilator triggers when the creature attacks, so the defending player sacrifices permanents in the declare attackers step, before blockers are declared (CR 702.86a, 508.1m): the Wall of Stone is the only permanent to sacrifice and the 7/7 is unblocked
